<title>JAPAN: Totoku Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Totoku Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 26.87		vs	   27.36</p>
<p> Operating    loss 95    million    vs	prft 416 million</p>
<p> Current	    144    million    vs	  622    million</p>
<p> Net		   74    million    vs	  316    million</p>
<p> EPS		    1.68 yen	  vs	    7.15 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     44 million	  vs	  44 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Totoku Electric Co Ltd makes electronic machinery and parts.</p>
</text>
